    750c,
    800c,
    850c,
    900c,
    950c,
    1000c,
    1050c,
    1100c,
    1150c
  )
)

// @description Holdrian comma system, 53 divisions of the octave. Used in Turkish makam theory. 1 step ≈ 22.64 cents.
